sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM Engine<br/>ZMQ Publisher
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ Subscriber<br/>5557/TCP
    participant Manager as KV Cache Manager<br/>Event Processor
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>6379/TCP
    participant Router as llm-d-router<br/>(External Caller)
    participant Scoring as Scoring API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconciler as Pod Reconciler<br/>controller-runtime
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over vLLM,Redis: KV Cache Event Ingestion Flow

    vLLM->>ZMQ: Publish KV cache events<br/>ZMQ pub/sub (TCP)
    ZMQ->>Manager: Receive cache event
    Manager->>Manager: Process with pool concurrency
    Manager->>Redis: Index cache block metadata<br/>go-redis (TCP or TLS via rediss://)
    Redis-->>Manager: ACK

    Note over Router,Redis: Scoring / Lookup Flow

    Router->>Scoring: POST /score_completions<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP
    Scoring->>Redis: Read KV cache index<br/>go-redis
    Redis-->>Scoring: Cache block data
    Scoring->>Scoring: Rank pods by cache affinity
    Scoring-->>Router: Ranked pod list (JSON)

    Note over Reconciler,K8sAPI: Pod Lifecycle Tracking Flow

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Watch /v1/Pod<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Pod create/delete events
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Update available<br/>cache source tracking

    Note over Manager,OTel: Observability Flow

    Manager->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC
    OTel-->>Manager: ACK
